MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_001: Haaah... Haaah... Damn it, that guy! He's a real\npain in the ham!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_002: Hey, is thaaat... Yeah, hey! Mikaela, help a guy\nout, will ya?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_003: If it isn't Guzran. What's got you all heated?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_004: That madman Dietrich! He attacked me in a tavern!\nYou HAVE to do something before he catches me!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_005: I was right in the middle of telling some rookies how\nI slew a sea monster WAY bigger than Cetus...
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_006: when he ran at me out of nowhere, swinging his\ndamn sword, demanding satisfaction!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_007: You fools make quite a pair. OK, hold tight.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_008: There, it's done—Dietrich's gone. Why are you both\nsuch headaches?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_009: Hehe! Guys being guys, that's all! Say, how'd you\nrun him off?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_010: I pointed out that if you were strong enough to do\nthat, you would have taken down Cetus yourself.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_011: Huh! Solid! Figured if anyone could deal with him,\nit'd be my old protégé—Mikaela Redblade!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_012: You and your silver tongue.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_013: Still, I can't deny we have history. I do owe you.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_014: I remember the days... What were you, 14, when\nyou stumbled into my mercenary troop?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_015: And look at you now. Paying it back! And with style!\nAllll part of my grand plan.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_016: Pull the other one. You're such a braggart.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_017: When we met you hadn't even pulled a job, but that\ndidn't stop you from crowing about your kill count.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_018: Haha! Yes! You spread that story around like a\ngood li'l parrot.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_019: And those training exercises I made up... You were\nALL in. The other mercs laughed and laughed!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_020: You'd stare 'em down, challenging 'em to fights.\nYeah, you'd be dead if it wasn't for my training.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_021: You talk yourself into trouble all the time, but you\nnever learn, do you? Even after all these years.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_022: A legend in my own time! And I just added another\nstory in my life of epic achievements!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_023: The story of how Unkillable Guzran defeated the\nMad Bull of Wherever without spilling any blood!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_024: Ahh. The only cure for you is death.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_C_025: Hey, come on... We're back in action, battle buddy!\nLet's grab a drink and catch up. Myyy treat!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_001: The more I listen to you talk, the more I wonder if\nany of your stories are true.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_002: Take the one about how you faked your death and\ncrawled out from under a pile of corpses to escape.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_003: Ah, Mars himself has never seen such a battle!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_004: Don't blaspheme. Truth is, you got knocked on the\nhead by a mercenary you were trying to seduce!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_005: The "fearsome foe" you faced was just a woman who\nrefused to bed you!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_006: Either way, an epic day to remember! Besides, didn't\nyou pick up YOUR guy on the battlefield?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_007: Don't go there. You'll spoil the moment.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_008: You know, I saw Olunga recently...
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_009: Is that a lie? I hope it's a lie.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_010: I wouldn't make up something like that. It's not a\nbold opening to any Unkillable Guzran story.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_011: He seemed desperate to get back with you. Said he\njust had to save up cash to make it all good again.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_012: OK, that I believe. That fool needs to let go.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_013: Please don't tell Mu about this. It's better if she\ndoesn't hear it.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_014: I've got to say, I'm more concerned about your\nfeelings. So, how DO you feel?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_015: Isn't it obvious? Done with him.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_016: He thinks he can fix everything if he comes crawling\nback with the money he wasted and a grin.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_017: Oh, you expect him to have that...thing you used to\ntalk about. Strength of character, was it?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_018: Once someone's torn a hole in your heart, nothing\ncan fix it. Nothing can fill it.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_019: Pathetic, isn't it? Usually I like it when someone\nstays true. But that's not how the heart works.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_020: I'm the one who's hung up on the past.
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_021: Oh, serious stuff... Well, OK. How about you let the\nUnkillable Guzran be your Heart-Fillable Guzran?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_022: You? Where'd that come from?
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_023: I've got two things going for me. Unlike Olunga, I'm\na fine fellow when drinking. Decent battler too!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_024: Also, despite your liking strength of character...you're\nstill palling around with me! A known show-off!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_025: So, let's be epic! Countless ladies have shipwrecked\nthemselves on my shore! Sail for adventure!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_026: Countless? Well, count me out! We're friends, but\nthat's it!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_027: Haha! There's the Mikaela I know! Now THIS is\nan epic tale we'll NEVER forget!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_028: How the Unkillable Guzran saved Mikaela Redblade\nfrom the depths of despair!
MID_SE_Mic_Guj_B_029: Will you cut it out? Less talking, more drinking!\nBarkeep, another round!